Third-party material
--------------------

Material Symbols — the inline SVG fallback icon paths embedded in
dist/m3listing.js and dist/top.html are taken from
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons and are licensed under the
Apache License 2.0.

Google Sans, Google Sans Text and Google Symbols — loaded at runtime from
fonts.googleapis.com by the two @import lines at the top of
dist/m3listing.css. These faces are not redistributed here; they are served
by Google under
https://fonts.google.com/license/googlerestricted. Removing the two @import
lines removes the dependency: the type falls back to Roboto/system fonts and
the icons fall back to the bundled Material Symbols SVG paths.
